Upstream ProkBot changes incorporated
-------------------------------------

ProkBot Plus 1.15.0 incorporates these changes from upstream ProkBot release
v2026.11.25 (https://gitee.com/ahaduoduoduo/ProkBot), by the upstream ProkBot
contributors (ahaduoduoduo), under the same license. They were adapted to
ProkBot Plus; the adaptations are listed in items 4 and 13 above.

  bd82070  fix(host): keep later fallbacks reachable after a quota failure
           (host/runtime/model-session.mjs, host/tests/model-fallback.test.mjs)
  bc99c75  fix(host): mount Host memory read-only, and only through an
           opt-in overlay (host/release/compose.yaml, compose.memory.yaml,
           host/deploy.py, host/release/backup.py,
           host/runtime/prompt-runtime.mjs and tests)
  7d7f51a  docs: memory reading needs deploy.py and Docker Engine 26+
           (rewritten for the ProkBot Plus documents)
  c3d8e85  fix(host): serve the web client on its own port and origin
           (host/server/index.mjs, web-routes.mjs, web-client.mjs, auth.mjs,
           security.mjs, public/, host/deploy/supervisor.mjs,
           host/release/Dockerfile.host, compose.yaml, compose.host.yaml and
           tests)
  f81f35e  fix(admin): say the web client bundle comes from ProkBot Plus
           (only the part that stops naming a fixed bundle file)
  a2fdb31  only the Host part: start(0) takes an ephemeral web client port;
           its desktop client part is not included yet

Third-party components
----------------------

Third-party components keep their own licenses. See host/THIRD_PARTY,
mac/THIRD_PARTY, ios/THIRD_PARTY and mac/patchers/desktop/node_modules.
ios/tools/hbc98/opcodes-v98.json derives its Hermes bytecode v98 opcode table
from Meta's facebook/hermes (include/hermes/BCGen/HBC/BytecodeList.def, MIT
License) using the JSON layout popularized by hbctool (MIT License); both
license texts are included in ios/THIRD_PARTY/.
android/shell/gradle/wrapper/ contains the Gradle Wrapper, and the prebuilt
Android shell includes parts of the Kotlin standard library; both are
licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Original Grok Bot programs
--------------------------

This repository contains no Grok Bot program files. The patch tools download
the official programs on the user's own machine, verify their hashes and patch
them there. Generated clients and web client bundles are not distributed.
Grok, Grok Bot and related names and marks belong to their respective owners.
ProkBot Plus is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.
